Template: ultimate/title
Type: title
Description: Debian Ultimate: init, kernel and desktop

Template: ultimate/init
Type: select
Choices-C: sysvinit, openrc, runit, systemd
Choices: SysV (Default), OpenRC (Recommended), runit, systemd
Default: sysvinit
Description: Init system:
 SysV, OpenRC and runit install Devuan (base without systemd).
 .
 systemd installs Debian stable instead and needs an Internet connection,
 because this disc only carries Devuan packages.

Template: ultimate/kernel
Type: select
Choices-C: linux-libre, linux
Choices: linux-libre (Default), linux (Recommended)
Default: linux-libre
Description: Kernel:
 linux-libre is 100% free software: it will not load closed firmware or
 CPU microcode updates (no fixes for Spectre-like CPU bugs).
 .
 ${HWNOTE}

Template: ultimate/desktop
Type: select
Choices-C: mate, xfce, cinnamon, gnome, gnome-flashback, kde, lxde, lxqt, none
Choices: MATE (Default), Xfce (Recommended), Cinnamon, GNOME, GNOME Flashback, KDE Plasma, LXDE, LXQt, None (console only)
Default: mate
Description: Desktop:
 The desktop environment to install.

Template: ultimate/progress
Type: text
Description: Installing the ${KERNEL} kernel...
